      "message": "refactor!: remove v4-deprecated APIs (#676)\n\nRemove the public symbols that were marked deprecated in v4.5.0, now that\nmain is the v5 clean-break trunk:\n\n- `deriveSecret` / `deriveBlindingFactor`: use `deriveSecretAndBlindingFactor`,\n  which derives both values for a counter in one call (and, for legacy BIP-32\n  keysets, avoids repeating the shared path derivation).\n- `Wallet.completeMelt` boolean `preferAsync` overload: pass\n  `{ preferAsync: true }` on the `CompleteMeltOptions` object instead. The two\n  overloads collapse back into a single signature.\n\nTests that consumed the removed helpers now derive the single values locally\nor pass the options object. Migration steps documented in migration-5.0.0.md.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "4cc5123b8b6ddcddbc532828a899049fe0c6de34",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/cashubtc/cashu-ts/git/trees/4cc5123b8b6ddcddbc532828a899049fe0c6de34"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/cashubtc/cashu-ts/git/commits/994675aa13ea382300923a5e18277dc709e19699",
      "comment_count": 0,
